  <prompt>
    Rewrite `docs/architecture/external-access-spa-architecture.md`, `docs/guides/EXTERNAL-ACCESS-ADMIN-SETUP.md`, and `docs/guides/EXTERNAL-ACCESS-SPA-GUIDE.md` to match the shipped SWA + CIAM implementation: SWA hosting (BrowserRouter + navigationFallback + security headers), the "Ciam" JwtBearer scheme with oid-based Contact resolution, admin-initiated onboarding (invite trigger, `isSignUpAllowed=false`, SSPR), broker-only app-only document download, and the RETIRED Power Pages + B2B-guest path. Code is the source of truth—document what was built; do not change code or propose new design.
  </prompt>

  <role>
    You are a technical writer + architect updating Spaarke's external-access documentation to
    match the shipped SWA + CIAM implementation. Code is the source of truth; the docs lag and you
    bring them current. You do not change code — you document what was built.
  </role>

  <goal>
    Rewrite `docs/architecture/external-access-spa-architecture.md`,
    `docs/guides/EXTERNAL-ACCESS-ADMIN-SETUP.md`, and `docs/guides/EXTERNAL-ACCESS-SPA-GUIDE.md`
    to reflect the migrated platform: Azure Static Web Apps hosting (BrowserRouter + navigationFallback
    + security headers), Microsoft Entra External ID (CIAM) identity (second "Ciam" JwtBearer scheme,
    resolve Contact by `oid`), admin-initiated onboarding (invite trigger, `isSignUpAllowed=false`,
    SSPR), broker-only app-only document download, and the RETIRED Power Pages + B2B-guest path.
  </goal>

  <context>
    <background>
      The migration moved hosting from Power Pages to Azure Static Web Apps and identity from Entra
      B2B guests to Entra External ID (CIAM), broker-only, and added admin-initiated onboarding + an
      app-only document download. Tasks 040/041 verified parity and decommissioned the Power Pages
      path. The three external-access docs still describe the old Power Pages hosting and B2B-guest
      identity model, so they are now stale and must be rewritten to reflect the CIAM/SWA reality —
      including the ADR-028 Amendment A1 identity model and the E-3 direct-Office boundary. Per root
      CLAUDE.md §2, code is the source of truth; these docs must not carry Power Pages/B2B
      instructions as current guidance.
    </background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file status="modify">docs/architecture/external-access-spa-architecture.md</file>
      <file status="modify">docs/guides/EXTERNAL-ACCESS-ADMIN-SETUP.md</file>
      <file status="modify">docs/guides/EXTERNAL-ACCESS-SPA-GUIDE.md</file>
      <file status="reference">.claude/adr/ADR-028-spaarke-auth-architecture.md (+Amendment A1 — CIAM identity model)</file>
      <file status="reference">src/client/external-spa/staticwebapp.config.json (SWA hosting facts to document)</file>
      <file status="reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/ExternalAccess/ (CIAM scheme, provisioner, download — source of truth)</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">
      SCOPE: the three external-access docs. Docs MUST reflect code as source of truth: no stale
      Power Pages or Entra B2B-guest instructions may remain as current guidance. The documented
      identity model MUST be CIAM (Entra External ID), and hosting MUST be SWA.
    </constraint>
    <constraint source="spec-FR-14">
      SCOPE: content accuracy. The rewrite MUST document SWA hosting, CIAM identity, admin-initiated
      onboarding, and broker-only app-only download, and MUST remove Power Pages-as-current
      hosting/deploy instructions.
    </constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028-A1">
      SCOPE: identity model. The identity model documented MUST match ADR-028 Amendment A1 — resolve
      Contact by `oid` (`sprk_externalobjectid`), broker-only (no OBO on the external path, no
      per-user B2B guest), with the E-3 direct-Office boundary noted as permanently out of scope.
    </constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <files>
      <file>projects/spaarke-SPA-external-access-platform-r1/spec.md</file>
